  "description": "Dependency injection helpers for the RubiconMp document processing pipeline. Supports legacy .NET Framework 4.6.2–4.8.1 apps as well as .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET 10. Most apps should install Rmp.DocProc.HtmlToPdf instead. Report issues at https://github.com/rubiconmp/public-issues",
